      <h3 class="major">What is Club Catalyst?</h3>
      <p>Club Catalyst is a District 80 initiative for the 2026/2027 Toastmasters year. Three members from a club visit another club's meeting, each taking on an active role — evaluator, Table Topics Master, timer, and more. It's about building connections across the District and learning from how other clubs run their sessions.</p>
      <p>BH II is taking part. Every visit is a chance to bring something new back to our own meetings.</p>

